cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NeSySy, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "NeSySy-bench"
abstract: >-
  NeSySy generates synthetic neurosymbolic learning tasks: random constraints over input and
  output variables (propositional, bounded intervals over reals, or linear inequalities over
  reals) together with datasets whose input-output pairs satisfy them, with parameters that
  control how hard the task is. It also contains the learners compared in the accompanying paper.
